  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.8:\n- Added backward compatibility support for .NET Framework 4.0\n- Added support for Castles POS USB\n- Fixed: USB not found on macOS Tahoe (26.5.2)\n\nv1.0.7:\n- Added support for Linux Arm64 and x64\n\nv1.0.6:\n- Improve core library on Windows arm64 and x64\n\nv1.0.5:\n- Add Windows arm64 support\n\nv1.0.4:\n- Add macOS arm64 support\n\nv1.0.3:\n- Update libABA_POS_SDK_CORE.so for Linux x64\n\nv1.0.2:\n- Update ABA_POS_SDK_CORE.dll for macOS x64\n\nv1.0.1:\n- Update CHANGELOG.md to CHANGELOG.txt\n\nv1.0.0:\n- Initial release \n- Support ABA POS SDK with native library binding\n- Support x64 architecture",
